#: includes/section/settings/botblocker-set-connect.php:22
msgid ""
"By restricting access from proxy servers, data centers, VPN endpoints, and "
"legacy protocols, you can significantly reduce automated threats while "
"maintaining seamless access for legitimate users. These settings are "
"particularly effective against sophisticated bot networks that attempt to "
"hide their origin through anonymizing services."
msgstr ""
"Al restringir el acceso desde servidores proxy, centros de datos, endpoints "
"VPN y protocolos heredados, puede reducir significativamente las amenazas "
"automatizadas mientras mantiene un acceso sin interrupciones para usuarios "
"legítimos. Estos ajustes son particularmente efectivos contra redes de bots "
"sofisticadas que intentan ocultar su origen a través de servicios de "
"anonimización."

#: includes/section/cloud/botblocker-cloud-about.php:19
msgid ""
"By using BotBlocker, you can effectively reduce unwanted traffic, prevent "
"automated attacks, and ensure that only real visitors have access to your "
"content. The plugin is easy to configure and works seamlessly with any "
"WordPress site."
msgstr ""
"Al usar BotBlocker, puede reducir efectivamente el tráfico no deseado, "
"prevenir ataques automatizados y asegurar que solo visitantes reales tengan "
"acceso a su contenido. El plugin es fácil de configurar y funciona "
"perfectamente con cualquier sitio WordPress."

