#| msgid ""
#| "Early initialization and/or MU plugin mode let BotBlocker reject \n"
#| "                requests at the very first IP gate: the user maintained "
#| "and \"automatically built \n"
#| "                blacklist (bots, malicious networks, previously blocked "
#| "IPs) \"is \n"
#| "                checked before heavier logic. With Early Init, WordPress "
#| "\"itself does not load at \n"
#| "                all, minimizing memory and CPU. With the MU plugin, "
#| "\"filtering executes before regular \n"
#| "                plugins and the theme, also saving resources. This "
#| "ensures \"only potentially clean traffic \n"
#| "                proceeds while junk is dropped as early as possible."
msgid ""
"Early initialization and/or MU plugin mode let BotBlocker reject \n"
"                requests at the very first IP gate: the user maintained and "
"automatically built \n"
"                blacklist (bots, malicious networks, previously blocked IPs) "
"is \n"
"                checked before heavier logic. With Early Init, WordPress "
"itself does not load at \n"
"                all, minimizing memory and CPU. With the MU plugin, "
"filtering executes before regular \n"
"                plugins and the theme, also saving resources. This ensures "
"only potentially clean traffic \n"
"                proceeds while junk is dropped as early as possible."
msgstr ""
"La inicialización temprana y/o el modo de plugin MU permiten a BotBlocker "
"rechazar \n"
"                solicitudes en la primera puerta IP: la lista negra "
"mantenida por el usuario y \"construida automáticamente \n"
"                (bots, redes maliciosas, IPs bloqueadas previamente) \"se \n"
"                comprueba antes de la lógica más pesada. Con Inicio Temprano,"
" WordPress \"en sí no se carga en \n"
"                absoluto, minimizando memoria y CPU. Con el plugin MU, \"el "
"filtrado se ejecuta antes de los plugins \n"
"                regulares y el tema, también ahorrando recursos. Esto "
"asegura \"que solo el tráfico potencialmente limpio \n"
"                proceda mientras la basura se descarta lo antes posible."

